/span>: Shall we go to a restaurant tonight?<br> <span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I would love that, thank you."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Andrew</span>: Why don't we go to the movies? <br> <span class=\"strong\">Brian</span>: I'd like to, but I need to finish my work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "invitation "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a message to ask a person to attend a special event"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to send the invitations for Vanessa's dinner."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about social occasions."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Shall we \u2026 ?"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "Should we \u2026 ; Let's \u2026"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Shall we try this new Mexican restaurant?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "option"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "choice "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Does the restaurant have many vegetarian options?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Gotta go!"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I have to go (informal)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Gotta go! See you tomorrow!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to take care of something"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be responsible for something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can call the restaurant and you can take care of the invitations."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to throw a party"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to organize a party"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We should throw a party before Vanessa leaves!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of three friends."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask them what they want to do for a special occasion."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Suggest a place. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Fill out the chart."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Do your friends accept the invitation? Answer Yes or No on the chart."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Where?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Answer\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about social occasions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask for preferences for a special occasion."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make invitations and suggestions."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn3le08ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le08ob01re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn3le08ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I can't believe Vanessa is leaving next week!  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, that's true. We should organize something before she leaves.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Why don't we throw a party?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hmm ... I'm not sure she would like to invite many people.<br>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn3le08ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You're right. What other options do we have?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Vanessa loves to eat out ...<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Shall we go to this new Mexican place then? El Taco Loco?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Why not? I'm sure she would like to go there.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Great! Who should we invite?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think she'd love to see the four of us.<br>", "id": 2, "time": "15500", "image": "engenn3le08ob01re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Perfect. I'll take care of John's invitation.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ok. I'll call the restaurant. I'm sure we need to book early.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Fantastic! Gotta go!<b